Needs entry.servedMs() inserted after penaltyMs.

Now write the two service methods:

```java
@Override
@Transactional
public ServiceResult registerPenaltyCredit(String raceId, RegisterPenaltyCreditRequest request) {
    return withIdempotency(request.requestId(), "REGISTER_PENALTY_CREDIT",
            orderedParams(
                    "raceId", raceId,
                    "creditId", request.creditId(),
                    "penaltyId", request.penaltyId(),
                    "bib", request.bib(),
                    "startUtcMs", request.startUtcMs(),
                    "endUtcMs", request.endUtcMs(),
                    "registeredBy", request.registeredBy(),
                    "expectedVersion", request.expectedVersion()),
            () -> {
                RaceRow race = requireOpenRace(raceId, request.expectedVersion());
                PenaltyRow penalty = repository.findPenalty(request.penaltyId())
                        .orElseThrow(() -> new NotFoundException("处罚不存在: " + request.penaltyId()));
                if (!penalty.raceId().equals(raceId)) {
                    throw new NotFoundException("处罚不属于该赛事: " + request.penaltyId());
                }
                if (penalty.type() != PenaltyType.ADD_TIME) {
                    throw new UnprocessableEntityException("执行凭证仅适用于加时处罚: " + request.penaltyId());
                }
                if (!penalty.bib().equals(request.bib())) {
                    throw new UnprocessableEntityException("凭证选手与处罚选手不一致: " + request.bib());
                }
                requireRunner(raceId, request.bib());
                long start = request.startUtcMs();
                long end = request.endUtcMs();
                if (end <= start) {
                    throw new UnprocessableEntityException("停留区间无效：结束时刻必须大于开始时刻");
                }
                long duration = end - start;
                long now = clock.millis();
                bumpVersion(race, request.expectedVersion());
                PenaltyCreditRow row = new PenaltyCreditRow(
                        request.creditId(), raceId, request.penaltyId(), request.bib(),
                        start, end, duration, request.registeredBy(),
                        PenaltyCreditStatus.PENDING, null, null, now, null);
                try {
                    repository.insertCredit(row);
                } catch (DuplicateKeyException ex) {
                    throw new ConflictException("凭证ID已存在: " + request.creditId());
                }
                PenaltyCreditRow saved = repository.findCredit(request.creditId()).orElseThrow();
                return ServiceResult.created(ResponseMapper.toCreditResponse(saved));
            });
}
```

Wait: should revoked penalty be allowed to register new credits? "处罚撤销后未确认凭证不能确认" — only confirm is blocked. Registering a credit on a revoked penalty... The spec says after revoke, unconfirmed credits can't be confirmed; confirmed credits retained but net penalty 0; restoring a penalty only allows adding a new penalty record, not reviving old credits. Registering a new credit against a revoked penalty would be pointless since it can never be confirmed. Should register be blocked for revoked penalty? Spec doesn't say explicitly. Hmm. "处罚撤销后未确认凭证不能确认" implies registration might still happen but confirmation blocked. To be safe, allow registration regardless of revoked status (spec only forbids confirmation). Actually allowing registration of a credit that can never be confirmed is odd but harmless. But maybe better to forbid? The spec explicitly lists 422 cases: 跨选手引用、取消资格处罚、无效区间. Revoked penalty registration isn't listed. I'll allow registration but confirmation will 409. Hmm, but that creates a weird state. Let me think about "恢复处罚只允许新增原有处罚记录，不复活旧凭证" — meaning if you revoke and then add a new penalty (new record), the old credits stay bound to the old revoked penalty and don't apply to the new one. That's naturally satisfied since credits bind by penaltyId.

I'll allow registration against revoked penalties (not forbidden by spec), confirmation blocked with 409.

Confirm method:

```java
@Override
@Transactional
public ServiceResult confirmPenaltyCredit(
        String raceId, String creditId, ConfirmPenaltyCreditRequest request) {
    return withIdempotency(request.requestId(), "CONFIRM_PENALTY_CREDIT",
            orderedParams(
                    "raceId", raceId,
                    "creditId", creditId,
                    "confirmedBy", request.confirmedBy(),
                    "expectedVersion", request.expectedVersion()),
            () -> {
                RaceRow race = requireOpenRace(raceId, request.expectedVersion());
                PenaltyCreditRow credit = repository.findCredit(creditId)
                        .orElseThrow(() -> new NotFoundException("执行凭证不存在: " + creditId));
                if (!credit.raceId().equals(raceId)) {
                    throw new NotFoundException("执行凭证不属于该赛事: " + creditId);
                }
                if (credit.status() == PenaltyCreditStatus.CONFIRMED) {
                    throw new ConflictException("执行凭证已确认: " + creditId);
                }
                if (credit.registeredBy().equals(request.confirmedBy())) {
                    throw new UnprocessableEntityException("确认裁判必须与登记裁判不同");
                }
                PenaltyRow penalty = repository.findPenalty(credit.penaltyId()).orElseThrow();
                if (penalty.revoked()) {
                    throw new ConflictException("处罚已撤销，未确认凭证不能确认: " + creditId);
                }
                // 同选手已确认停留区间不得重叠（左闭右开，相邻合法）。
                for (PenaltyCreditRow confirmed :
                        repository.findConfirmedCreditsForRunner(raceId, credit.bib())) {
                    if (credit.startUtcMs() < confirmed.endUtcMs()
                            && confirmed.startUtcMs() < credit.endUtcMs()) {
